` defaults to false (`agent/agent_init.py:336`).\n- This behavior was introduced by `e4a3ffa9c` (`feat: use SOUL.md as primary agent identity instead of hardcoded default (#1922)`) and shipped in `v2026.3.23`.\n\nFor a named profile, the persona file must be in that profile's active Hermes home (`$HERMES_HOME/SOUL.md`); current documentation confirms each profile has its own SOUL.md.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4958839601/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]